    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d102-a5">

                <pb facs="0218" n="148" xml:id="pg148"/>

                <head>Commander Kirkland to Mr.
                        Asboth</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Steamer Wasp,</hi> (4th
                            rate,) <hi rendition="#italic">Off Buenos Ayres,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-03-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 9, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your communication of this date, and also of the enclosed letter to the
                    commander-in-chief for the time being, his excellency the Marquis de Caxias, of
                    the allied army.</p>
                <p>I will have an officer sent from this vessel, to be at the legation of the United
                    States tomorrow morning, the 10th instant, at 8 o’clock a. m., in order to
                    receive and receipt for the box containing the despatches, &amp;c., for his
                    excellency the Hon. Chas. A. Washburn, the United States minister to Paraguay,
                    and on receiving them on board will immediately proceed with them to their
                    destination.</p>
                <p>I take the occasion to offer to you my services in any way that I can assist
                    you.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. A. KIRKLAND, <hi rendition="#italic">Lieut. Commander U. S. N.,
                            Commanding U. S. Steamer Wasp.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Major General <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Asboth,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">United States Minister to Argentine
                            Confederation.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
